                        </a>
                        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XnKsbXW72-8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="music-card">
                            <div class="music-card-icon">🌙</div>
                            <h3 class="music-category">Classical</h3>
