                    <p class="section-text">
                        Cyril, on the other hand, is a name that carries a classical resonance. It's like a beautifully bound old book, possessing both academic rigor and gentlemanly gentleness. Even though the name carries a somewhat dignified connotation in Greek, I strive to make my life as serene and refined as the "grandeur" it derives from.
